: \"And when the dust settles and the adrenaline fades, Platform Shampoo ensures your hair remains as bold and electrifying as ever.\"\n\n[Close-up on Nathan\u2019s face as he applies Platform Shampoo in the bathroom, the lather bubbling up and disappearing, his hair quickly restoring its natural sheen.]\n\nNarrator: \"For the adventurer in all of us, Platform Shampoo offers a refreshing start and sets the foundation for the next amazing journey.\"\n\n[Scene: Nathan, now calm and collected, with perfectly styled hair, stepping out into another day.]\n\nNarrator: \"Why wait? Protect your locks and prepare to face whatever tomorrow brings with Platform Shampoo.\"\n\n[Closing Scene: Company logo and tagline appear on screen.]\n\nNarrator: \"Platform Shampoo. Powering the next great adventure.\"\n\n[Screen fades to black with the sound of a dramatic, rising symphony, ending with a solid thud as the camera cuts to black.]\n\nNarrator: (Voiceover, more determined) \"Platform Shampoo. The key to a legendary look. Try it now, and see the difference for yourself.\"\n\n[SwitchConversation]"}, {"key": [392, 3, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -0.00031387997285931094, "log_surv_s": -0.00017880430468027956, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [392, 3, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -0.000499693449836819, "log_surv_s": -0.000890939616417185, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [392, 3, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -0.009768330084625288, "log_surv_s": -0.009720455418026958, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [398, 3, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -0.0008002075576087264, "log_surv_s": -0.0015380751950922862, "gen_len": 426, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [398, 3, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -2.17789293035755e-05, "log_surv_s": -1.2297883966744918e-05, "gen_len": 420, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [398, 3, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -9.135808142305276e-06, "log_surv_s": -8.304219914629732e-08, "gen_len": 359, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": 